<view class="p-box">
  <view class="l-title border-b">打印机列表</view>
  <view
    class="p-list"
    data-index="{{index}}"
    wx:if="{{printList.length>0}}"
    wx:for="{{printList}}"
    wx:key="index"
  >
    <view class="p-item border-b">
      <view>
        <text class="iconfont icon-shuchudayin"></text>
        <text class="p-name" wx:if="{{item.remark}}"
          >{{item.remark}}（{{item.name=='未知设备'?item.localName:item.name}}）</text
        >
        <text class="p-name" wx:else
          >{{item.name=='未知设备'?item.localName:item.name}}</text
        >
      </view>
      <view class="p-add-right">
        <view class="p-add">已连接</view>
        <image
          bindtap="delAdvice"
          id="{{index}}"
          mode="aspectFit"
          src="{{icon.delete}}"
        ></image>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
<view class="p-box">
  <view class="l-title border-b">搜索打印机设备</view>
  <view class="p-list border-b">
    <view
      bindtap="connectDevice"
      class="p-item border-b"
      data-index="{{index}}"
      wx:for="{{storageList}}"
      wx:key="index"
    >
      <view>{{item.name=='未知设备'?item.localName:item.name}}</view>
      <view class="p-add"
        >{{contentStatus=='true'?'已连接':'点击连接'}}<image
          mode="aspectFit"
          src="{{icon.imageSm}}"
        ></image>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
<view class="tip-box">
  <view class="l-title border-b">
    <text>操作说明</text>
    <image
      bindtap="onShowExplain"
      mode="aspectFit"
      src="{{icon.printquest}}"
    ></image>
  </view>
  <view class="tip-item-title">连接打印机</view>
  <view class="tip-item">1、打开打印机，并使打印机在唤醒状态；</view>
  <view class="tip-item">2、打开手机蓝牙，部分安卓手机需要打开“定位”功能</view>
  <view class="tip-item">3、点击扫描打印机，选中打印机后即可</view>
</view>
<view class="fd-btn">
  <button bindtap="research" class="g_bottomBtn">扫描打印机</button>
</view>
<van-action-sheet
  bind:click-overlay="onShowExplain"
  bind:close="onShowExplain"
  class="explain_content"
  show="{{showExplain}}"
  title="打印说明"
>
  <view class="tip-box">
    <view class="tip-item-title">如遇无法连接</view>
    <view class="tip-item">1、检查打印机是否唤醒</view>
    <view class="tip-item">2、检查是否给与APP/微信/小程序蓝牙权限</view>
    <view class="tip-item"
      >3、重启打印机、重启蓝牙、重启微信、重启APP、重启手机</view
    >
    <view class="tip-item">4、联系秉羲工作台客服，客服电话: {{servicePhone}}</view>
    <view class="tip-item-title">其他说明：</view>
    <view class="tip-item">1、打印机型号：HM-A300L、HM-A300S、HM-A350</view>
    <view class="tip-item">2、纸张尺寸：</view>
    <view class="tip-item">（1）标签打印：70*40、60*40、38*30（双排）</view>
    <view class="tip-item">（2）色号打印：70*40、60*40、38*30（双排）</view>
    <view class="tip-item">（3）布头打印：60*80、80*100</view>
    <view class="tip-item"
      >3、纸张类型：热敏纸（如无法找到，可在淘宝搜索秉羲工作台）</view
    >
  </view>
  <button bindtap="onShowExplain" class="popBtn">我知道了</button>
</van-action-sheet>
